@* Opens on hover AND focus: a tooltip only reachable by mouse is one half the users never see.
   Escape closes it, and the pointer may travel into the tip — which matters the moment a tip
   holds a key or a link. The trigger is described by the tip, not named by it. *@
<Tooltip>
    <TooltipTrigger Target="demo-tip" Variant="outline">Hover</TooltipTrigger>
    <TooltipContent Id="demo-tip">Add to library</TooltipContent>
</Tooltip>
